# PhpStan and Mago (PHP)

When changing PHP code (or before finishing a PHP-related task), run these **from the project root** so the agent uses the repo’s pinned tools, not global installs:

1. **`./vendor/bin/phpstan`** — static analysis (uses `phpstan.neon`; default command is analyse).
2. **`./vendor/bin/mago lint`** — Mago linter. (`./vendor/bin/mago lint --fix` for auto fixing some issues).
3. **`./vendor/bin/mago fmt`** — Mago formatter; run after substantive edits so style matches the project.

Fix reported issues before considering the task done. If only `mago.toml` changed, still run **`./vendor/bin/mago lint`** and **`./vendor/bin/mago fmt`**.
